Three changes in the master task list have been made (now at version 2.8a):

1.  Julio Sanchez <jsanchez@gmv.es> has been added as the coordinator for
the task of "Research on use of shorthand forms".

2.  David Morgan <morgan@socs.uts.edu.au> has been added as the coordinator
for the task of "Syntax diagrams".

3.  Michael Barr <barr@triples.Math.McGill.CA> has been added as a
volunteer in the task of "Research on syntax for commutative diagrams" and
has expressed a possible interest in serving as coordinator if no one else
desires to do so; however, he cannot serve in this capacity until October
18 at the earliest.  To provide a point of contact, I will serve as the
TEMPORARY coordinator for this area until a suitable person is identified.
I have contacted Kris Rose regarding his interest in the task.

